 "note": "Client side: truncated: true and coverage partial are shown and the client keeps consuming the live stream; it does not reopen for them. It reopens once on an actual sequence gap (5 missing before 6). Resync triggers are only a sequence gap, a fenced conversation, another generation, or close with a reason."
}